	(text "S - Mode select pin: strong pull down to GND=high speed mode, strong\npull up to VCC=low power mode,10kΩ to 100kΩ pull down to\nGND=slope control mode\n\nVIO = Shutdown input, CMOS/TTL compatible. When the SHDN is driven\nto HIGH, it is turned off in low current mode. Inside there is a\npull-down resistor to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
